1:10:42Z"},"body":"See: https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/5748\r\n\r\nThe proposal involves adding the ImageLoaderDDS class, moving the DDS handling code inside it, and reusing the image loader (or part of it) in the texture loader in the future.\r\n\r\nWe are not supporting saving non-2d textures at this moment. Feature enhancement wanted.\r\n\r\n- [x] ~~BetsyCompressor has a runtime execution error~~ Rendering team is handling it.\r\n- [x] Only handle saving 2d-textures (like not 3d or 2d arrays)\r\n- [x] Pass GitHub actions tests\r\n- [x] Expand the list of supported Image::Formats and DDSFormats\r\n- [x] Extract common header from DDS reader and DDS writer\r\n- [x] Debug why BPTC dds loading isn't working\r\n   - [x] Fix BPTC unit test\r\n- [x] Stress test the system with an example project https://v-sekai.github.io/manuals/decisions/20250122-VRChat-Loader-with-Godot-Engine.html\r\n  - [x] In a GDScript project, create a web server (Godot Engine) to export from its current scene with all images repacked as a GLTF2 binary DDS and png/jpeg on HTTP GET.\r\n  - [x] https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/godot-http-glb-host\r\n- [x] Add `Image.load_dds_from_buffer()`\r\n- [x] Add `Image.save_dds_from_buffer()`\r\n- [x] `Error save_dds(const String &p_path) const`\r\n- [x] `Vector<uint8_t> save_dds_to_buffer() const`\r\n- [x] Refactor DDS image preparation, update function signatures, and improve mipmap handling\r\n- [x] Enhance DDS functionality by adding image saving, buffer handling, and loading capabilities\r\n- [x] Expand DDS tests with image format conversions, metric checks, and compression methods\r\n- [x] Update the DDS loader to use buffers in tests and handle unsupported formats\r\n- [x]  Improve DDS image saver to handle all mipmap levels and validate data sizes\r\n- [x]  Fix include guards and formatting in DDS image saver header files\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://ava